      "headline": "Late Bronze Age Collapse",
      "text": "The collapse of several civilizations in the Eastern Mediterranean, including the Hittites and Mycenaeans, affects the Levant."
    },
    {
      "date": "-01100",
      "headline": "Iron Age Begins",
      "text": "The Levant enters the Iron Age, characterized by the emergence of new political entities such as the Phoenicians and Israelites."
    },
    {
      "date": "-01000",
      "headline": "Rise of the Phoenicians",
      "text": "The Phoenicians establish powerful city-states and become renowned for their maritime trade and the spread of the alphabet."
    },
