      "text": "The Darfur conflict began in 2003, involving government forces and rebel groups, leading to a humanitarian crisis and international attention."
    },
    {
      "date": "2005",
      "headline": "Comprehensive Peace Agreement",
      "text": "The Comprehensive Peace Agreement was signed in 2005, ending the Second Sudanese Civil War and granting autonomy to Southern Sudan."
    },
    {
      "date": "2011-07-09",
      "headline": "South Sudan Independence",
      "text": "South Sudan seceded from Sudan on July 9, 2011, following a referendum, becoming an independent nation."
    },
    {
      "date": "2019-04-11",
      "headline": "Omar al-Bashir Overthrown",
      "text": "Omar al-Bashir was overthrown in a military coup on April 11, 2019, after months of protests against his rule."
    },
