      "headline": "Construction Begins",
      "text": "The carving of Mount Rushmore officially began, with President Calvin Coolidge attending the dedication ceremony."
    },
    {
      "date": "1930",
      "headline": "George Washington's Head Completed",
      "text": "The head of George Washington was completed and dedicated, marking the first of the four presidents to be finished."
    },
    {
      "date": "1936",
      "headline": "Thomas Jefferson's Head Completed",
      "text": "The head of Thomas Jefferson was completed and dedicated, following the initial attempt which had to be redone."
    },
    {
      "date": "1937",
      "headline": "Theodore Roosevelt's Head Completed",
