      "text": "Peter delivered a sermon on the day of Pentecost, which led to the conversion of about 3,000 people, marking the beginning of the Christian Church."
    },
    {
      "date": "0044",
      "headline": "Imprisonment and Escape",
      "text": "Peter was imprisoned by King Herod Agrippa I but was miraculously freed by an angel, as recounted in the Acts of the Apostles."
    },
