      "text": "Ivan I of Moscow was granted the title of Grand Prince of Vladimir, making Moscow the capital of the Vladimir-Suzdal principality."
    },
    {
      "date": "1380",
      "headline": "Battle of Kulikovo",
      "text": "Dmitry Donskoy of Moscow led Russian forces to a significant victory over the Mongol-Tatar army at the Battle of Kulikovo."
    },
