      "text": "The Sinaloa Cartel was formed in 1989 following the arrest of Miguel Ángel Félix Gallardo, the leader of the Guadalajara Cartel. The organization was established by Joaquín 'El Chapo' Guzmán, Héctor Luis Palma Salazar, and Ismael 'El Mayo' Zambada."
